==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Croco]]s spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 3.33~13.33 seconds<sup>100f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Baa Baa]]s spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 3.33~20 seconds<sup>100f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Hippoe]]s spawn after 120 seconds<sup>3,600f</sup>, delay 30~60 seconds<sup>900f~1,800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Pigge]]s spawn after 120 seconds<sup>3,600f</sup>, delay 30~60 seconds<sup>900f~1,800f</sup>.
*1 [[Le'boin]] spawns after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Le'boin]]s spawn after 233.33 seconds<sup>7,000f</sup>, delay 133.33~200 seconds<sup>4,000f~6,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Begin the battle by upgrading the [[Worker Cat]] to max level. When the enemies get close to your base, send out a few [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Tank Cats]]. Don't spend your money on anything else, and just save it for later. When Le'boin appears, go all-out with meatshields, [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Gross Cats]], [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Lizard Cats]], and most importantly [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Titan Cats]]. Once you kill Le'boin, victory is guaranteed.

Alternatively, you can cheese the stage before Le'boin spawns. This strategy takes less time, but requires a bit more strength. Just spam heavy hitting units such as [[Bird Cat (Normal Cat)|Bird Cat]] to destroy the enemy base before Le'boin comes out. Speedy cats such as [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Cow Cat]] or [[Mr. (Special Cat)|Mr.]] greatly assist with destroying the enemy base fast enough.

