==Trivia==
*In the [[Nyanko Daisensou|Japanese version]], this stage takes place in '''Saitama Prefecture'''.
*The rice cracker on Saitama Prefecture's base is a [https://youtu.be/W8417GlMqB4 ''senbei''], well-known throughout Japan but popularized in and to this day synonymous with Sōka, Saitama.

